The PNG brand marks in this directory (openai, anthropic, google, deepseek,
meta, mistral) are rasterized at 128x128 from the plain (non-color) SVG
marks in Lobe Icons (https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons), with no
changes to their geometry, so the application can tint them to any theme
color at load time via their alpha channel -- the same convention used for
the rest of assets/icons.

Lobe Icons is distributed under the MIT License, reproduced in full below.
These are third-party trademarks of their respective owners (OpenAI,
Anthropic, Google, DeepSeek, Meta, Mistral AI); their use here is solely to
identify each provider in the model list, not to imply endorsement.

